# Only api/ and public/ belong in the deployment. slidex.py is the local capture
# program: it needs PortAudio and a microphone, neither of which exist there.
#
# It is also deliberately not called main.py -- Vercel's Python preset treats a
# root main.py/app.py/index.py/server.py as the app entrypoint and fails the
# build when it does not export `app` or `handler`.
slidex.py
deck_pdf.py
exports
tools
Pipfile
